  "scope": "Actual frozen ProviderManager, UserView and UserViewMetadataService; controlled metadata/library dependencies. Eleven native controls include five queue controls. Queue regression projects only service events, errors, concurrency and disposal milestones; no actual SQL or HTTP host.",
